      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Perron inversion provides two contour routes from analytic data back to primes: moving only within a zero-free region bounds Psi through the pole at one and edge estimates, whereas moving far left crosses zeros and records their residues in an explicit formula, with the functional equation supplying control and definition on the remote side.",
